# Build context exclusions.
#
# The context is the repository root (docker-compose sets context: ..), so
# anything not listed here is uploaded to the Docker daemon on every build.
# Before this file was expanded, that included the 5.1 GB Qdrant snapshot and
# both .env files.
#
# Nothing excluded here is referenced by a COPY in docker/Dockerfile. The two
# paths the Dockerfile does need from outside config/ and src/ are scripts/
# and tests/fixtures/golden_queries.json, so tests/ is deliberately NOT
# excluded wholesale.

.git
.gitignore
README.md

# Secrets — never belong in a build context, COPYed or not
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docker/.env

# Large artefacts
*.snapshot
data/
notebooks/
rag_info/

# Local environments and caches
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
node_modules/

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Claude Code workspace
.claude/
